msgid "Ephemeris alignment: \n\nPreperation:\n- Batch solve the images in the viewer.\n- Batch annotate the images in the viewer.\n\nStacking:\n- Select manual/ephemeris alignment\n- Browse for all the images in the image tab and add if available the dark, flats.\n- Double click on one of the image files to open in the viewer. This will fill in tab alignment the option combobox with all annotations.\n- Select from the option combobox the asteroid to align on.\n- Hit the analyse button in the image tab. This fill all the x,y positions in the image list based on the object annotation selected.\n- If all okay, hit the stack button. "
msgstr "星历对齐：\n\n准备：\n- 在查看器中批量求解图像。\n- 在查看器中批量标注图像。\n\n叠加：\n- 选择手动/星历对齐。\n- 在“图像”标签页浏览并加入全部图像；如有暗场、平场也一并加入。\n- 双击其中一个图像文件在查看器中打开；这会把所有标注填入“对齐”标签页的选项下拉框。\n- 在选项下拉框中选择要对齐的小行星。\n- 点击“图像”标签页中的“分析”按钮；程序会根据所选天体标注填充图像列表中的 x,y 位置。\n- 如果结果正常，点击“叠加”按钮。"

